e is **no visual or contextual link to “second hunting”** in these frames, nor any indication that the snowmobile’s inability to reverse is a consequence of hunting.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThere is **no evidence in the 30 frames** to support the claim that “Their snowmobile can't reverse.” The snowmobile is simply parked, and the family appears to be in a relaxed, social setting — possibly preparing for or returning from an activity, but not dealing with any mechanical issue.\n\n✅ **Therefore, answer ‘4’ is incorrect based on the visual evidence provided.**"}, {'batch_start': 360, 'batch_end': 371, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1795.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1796.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1797.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1798.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1799.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1800.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1801.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1802.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1803.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1804.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1805.jpg'], 'response': "Based on the provided 11 frames and the specific criteria for evaluating whether “Their snowmobile can't reverse” is correct, the answer **‘4’ is NOT correct**.\n\nHere’s the detailed analysis:\n\n---\n\n### **1. Does the scene show a snowmobile with multiple people on it?**\n❌ **No.** None of the 11 frames show a snowmobile at all, let alone one with multiple people on it. The scenes are entirely indoors — showing storage areas, shelves with bones/ivory, and a workshop with a band saw.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Do people a